# README
(R/'README.md').write_text('''# Open Pathways Limb Support Network\n\nOriginal nonprofit website concept inspired only by the general functionality of limb-loss support organizations. No Amputee Coalition logo, exact branding, exact copy, or proprietary assets are used.\n\n## Included\n18+ HTML pages, shared `styles.css`, shared `script.js`, responsive navigation, professional CTA buttons, accessibility features, reduced-motion support, animated statistics, filters, resource search, forms, modal dialogs and donation UI.\n\n## Pages\nHome, About Us, Getting Started, Find Support, Resource Center, Support Groups, Peer Support, Youth Programs, Caregiver Resources, Healthcare Navigation, Research, Events, News & Blog, Stories, Advocacy, Volunteer, Donate, Contact, plus News & Events/Get Involved utility pages.\n\n## Production notes\nThe forms, search, donation flow and social links are UI demos. Connect them to your preferred backend/CMS/payment provider. Replace demo photography with properly licensed or owned images and verify all organizational statistics before publishing.\n''')
print('pages',len(list(R.glob('*.html'))))
